      "body": "## Motivation\nOn SM120 (RTX PRO 5000/6000 Blackwell), DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash crashes on the first forward once the candidate indexer is allowed to run (see #42371):\n```\ndeep_gemm.fp8_fp4_paged_mqa_logits -> Assertion error (layout.hpp:45): t.is_cuda()\n  via _low_ratio_index_topk -> full_topk._deep_gemm_decode\n```\nThe c1/c2 (low-ratio) indexers always score with DeepGEMM's FP4 paged MQA kernel. On SM120 that kernel schedules split_kv=128, but the default JIT metadata planner (`SGLANG_OPT_USE_JIT_INDEXER_METADATA=1`) encodes split_kv=256. The existing guard covers only the FP4 c4 indexer (`--enable-deepseek-v4-fp4-indexer`).\n\n## Modifications\n`force_deep_gemm_metadata` is now also True for `compress_ratio in (1, 2)` on SM120. Other platforms and the c4 path are unchanged.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n8x RTX PRO 5000 72GB, DP8 attention + EP8. Tree: upstream `a90e9c5d` + #42371 + the other SM120 PRs.\n- Without this change, the first forward crashes in `deep_gemm_fp4_paged_mqa_logits` (`index_logits.py:108`) with the traceback above.\n- With it: GSM8K (5-shot, 1319 questions) 0.905, invalid 0.000.\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\nNo perf change is intended; this is a correctness fix.\n### Validation of the combined branches\nI validated a clean tree: upstream `a90e9c5d` plus #42371 plus this PR and the three companion SM120 PRs (DeepGEMM metadata, b12x MXFP8, mHC BLOCK_K, RTX PRO 5000 configs). It ran on 8x RTX PRO 5000, DP8 attention + EP8, with `--fp8-gemm-backend flashinfer_cutlass`:\n\n| | GSM8K | 32K/1K req/s | 3K/100 req/s | 32K prefill tok/s | bs1 TPOT |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| clean branches | 0.905 | 0.807 | 9.59 | 12020 | 17.4 ms |\n| env-gated dev build (reference) | 0.913 | 0.801 | 9.59 | 11734 | 18.0 ms |\n\n\n## Checklist\n- [x] Format with pre-commit\n- [x] Accuracy test above\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #39346497152](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39346497152)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #39346496970](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39346496970)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #39346497183](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39346497183)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
