    {
      "body": "Depends on #42371 (candidate indexer on SM120). Related SM120 PRs: #45262 (b12x MXFP8), #45263 (RTX PRO 5000 configs), #45264 (mHC BLOCK_K).",
      "created_at": "2026-10-20T00:15:09Z",
