    {
      "body": "@Fridge003 @ispobock Could you take a look and `/tag-and-rerun-ci` when you get a chance? This fixes a first-forward crash of DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash on SM120 (RTX PRO 5000/6000); it's needed on top of #42371. Validated on 8x RTX PRO 5000 (GSM8K 0.905). Thanks!",
      "created_at": "2026-10-20T01:37:14Z",
